IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `aca-citizenship`

-- Australian Citizenship Act 2007 (Cth), ss 2, 4, 5, 12, 16-19A, 21(2), 22, 24-26, 28 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_australian-citizenship-act-2007.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

